## Forbidden

- Direct live DB program writes from lender submissions  
- Lender-specific form schemas that bypass Product Master templates  
- Overwriting existing program versions on publish  
- Mounting the public portal under `(dashboard)` employee chrome  
- Submissions without ECM Contact ID or Dialogue Thread ID  

